<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="CH8x3503-en-0b94e6d8" type="transl"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>Translation of  into (English)</title><editor role="translator">AI - Gemini</editor></titleStmt><publicationStmt><ab>published electronically as part of the TLS project at https://hxwd.org</ab><availability status="2"><ab>This work has been licensed for use in the TLS</ab></availability></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title/>2026</bibl><ab>Translation of <bibl corresp="#CH8x3503"><title xml:lang="och"/></bibl> into <lang xml:lang="en">English</lang>.</ab></sourceDesc></fileDesc><profileDesc><creation resp="#CH">Initially created: <date>2026-03-20T07:52:18.287+09:00</date> by CH</creation></profileDesc></teiHeader><text><body><div><head>Translated parts</head><p xml:id="CH8x3503-start"><seg corresp="#CH8x3503_CHANT_001-1a.99" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-20T07:53:13.014+09:00">The wicked become good</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3503_CHANT_001-1a.100" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-20T07:53:13.014+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH8x3503_CHANT_001-1a.101" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-20T07:53:13.014+09:00">... the good are truly good.</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3503_CHANT_001-1a.102" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-20T07:53:13.014+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH8x3503_CHANT_001-1a.103" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-20T07:53:13.014+09:00">Therefore, the good ruler perfects their system, and the people [missing character(s)]</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3503_CHANT_001-1a.104" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-20T07:53:13.014+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH8x3503_CHANT_001-1a.105" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-20T07:53:13.014+09:00">... Win and then stop.</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3503_CHANT_001-1a.106" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-20T07:53:13.014+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH8x3503_CHANT_001-1a.107" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-20T07:53:13.014+09:00">To go forth</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3503_CHANT_001-1a.108" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-20T07:53:13.014+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH8x3503_CHANT_001-1a.109" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-20T07:53:13.014+09:00">... is truly great.</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3503_CHANT_001-1a.110" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-20T07:53:13.014+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH8x3503_CHANT_001-1a.111" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-20T07:53:13.014+09:00">With a single [missing character], all under heaven is unified.</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3503_CHANT_001-1a.112" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-20T07:53:13.014+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH8x3503_CHANT_001-1a.113" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-20T07:53:13.014+09:00">Therefore, if the trouble is within a hundred *lǐ* (a traditional Chinese unit of distance, approximately 500 meters), one does not mobilize a one-day campaign.</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3503_CHANT_001-1a.116" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-20T07:53:13.014+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH8x3503_CHANT_001-1a.117" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-20T07:53:13.014+09:00">If the trouble is within a thousand *lǐ*, one does not mobilize a one-month campaign.</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3503_CHANT_001-1a.120" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-20T07:53:13.014+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH8x3503_CHANT_001-1a.121" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-20T07:53:13.014+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH8x3503_CHANT_001-1a.122" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-20T07:53:13.014+09:00">If [missing character(s)] within the Four Seas (i.e., the entire realm), one does not mobilize a one-year campaign.</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3503_CHANT_001-1a.126" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-20T07:53:13.014+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH8x3503_CHANT_001-1a.127" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-20T07:53:13.014+09:00">Having defeated their state in battle, one then attacks its [missing character(s)] state,</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3503_CHANT_001-1a.131" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-20T07:53:13.014+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH8x3503_CHANT_001-1a.132" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-20T07:53:13.014+09:00">but does not attack its capital.</seg></p></div></body></text></TEI>